# CompactList value tones changed in place (review-only, no goldens): set_value and update_row repaint a value whose
# only change is its tone, Normal -> Muted (the label grey, for an absent / unset thing) and back, on a plain row and
# on the selected row (the #2B2B2B bar). expect_color checks the style and the drawn pixels; the scene fails otherwise.
title compact list value tones
review
sizes 640x480 800x480 480x320
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
listdemo comfortable 12
expect_color 115200 00CC66
expect_color /dev/ttyUSB0 00CC66
listdemo value 1 muted 115200
expect_color 115200 9A9A9A
listdemo row 3 muted "Not set"
expect_color "Not set" 9A9A9A
listdemo value 0 muted /dev/ttyUSB0
expect_color /dev/ttyUSB0 9A9A9A
shot list_tones_muted
listdemo row 0 normal /dev/ttyUSB0
expect_color /dev/ttyUSB0 00CC66
listdemo value 2 bad Failed
expect_color Failed FF6666
listdemo value 2 muted Failed
expect_color Failed 9A9A9A
shot list_tones_back
